  "post_content": "<p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;\"><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#000000\">(232 fotos de toda la Feria) El Ayuntamiento de Onda estima que el impacto econ&oacute;mico de la Feria Medieval ha sido de cercano al mill&oacute;n de euros, que la ocupaci&oacute;n en restaurantes y hoteles ha llegado al 100% y habr&aacute; habido unas 10.000 visitas, seg&uacute;n datos de la Polic&iacute;a Local.</font></span></span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firamedievalonda2019/img_0028.jpg\" alt=\"img_0028\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firamedievalonda2019/img_0030.jpg\" alt=\"img_0030\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firamedievalonda2019/img_0031.jpg\" alt=\"img_0031\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firamedievalonda2019/img_0033.jpg\" alt=\"img_0033\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firamedievalonda2019/img_0035.jpg\" alt=\"img_0035\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firamedievalonda2019/img_0036.jpg\" alt=\"img_0036\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firamedievalonda2019/img_0037.jpg\" alt=\"img_0037\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firamedievalonda2019/img_0038.jpg\" alt=\"img_0038\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firamedievalonda2019/img_0